  dragon head  onto one arm at some point  this character seems to be really  important and his main weapon has a lion  crest on it which  is the same crest that you see on many  enemies and banners throughout this  trailer  perhaps he's the main boss of this area  and speaking of which i assume this area  with the tree and with the plains and  the castle  i assume it's all part of just one  kingdom and that there are many other  open worlds to explore that we haven't  quite seen yet  so there are a lot more tiny secrets in  this trailer but thank you  for watching and supporting and just  enjoy watching this channel for the next  few weeks  as we discuss this game to death i'll  see you soon  you
 

